"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1610438006:1":{"text":"1위, <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>... 정말 주목할 만한 학생이군요.","source_cn":"第一名，<style=stress><player_n...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x41DC3FDC2FB79EB2","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"1위, <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>... 정말 주목할 만한 학생이군요.","female":"1위, <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>... 정말 주목할 만한 학생이군요.","variant_male_record_index":"205443","variant_female_record_index":"205444","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1610438007:1":{"text":"2위, 카세디아. 3위, 그로웬.","source_cn":"第二名，科丝蒂；第三名，格墨文。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE151FBBAE3C10873","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1610438008:1":{"text":"딜그레이가 학생들의 이름을 하나씩 호명했다. 익숙한 이름들이 이어졌고, 마지막은...","source_cn":"迪尔格雷一一报出学生的姓名，你听到了各种熟悉的名字，直...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x85C6ECCD0E6D8210","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"딜그레이가 학생들의 이름을 하나씩 호명했다. 익숙한 이름들이 이어졌고, 마지막은...","female":"딜그레이가 학생들의 이름을 하나씩 호명했다. 익숙한 이름들이 이어졌고, 마지막은...","variant_male_record_index":"205446","variant_female_record_index":"205447","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1610438009:1":{"text":"...10위는 피파. “행운의 여신”이 미소를 지어줬군요. 바로 아래 11위와는 고작 3초 차이였습니다. 축하합니다.","source_cn":"……第十名，皮帕小姐，一位幸运的朋友。她与第十一名只有...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3AC0874B4992197F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1610438010:1":{"text":"후... 겨우 통과했네...","source_cn":"呼……总算通过了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x684C2632F5EEB1CD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1610438011:1":{"text":"위 10명의 학생은 내일 <style=\"highlight\">아침 9시</style>까지 학교 <style=\"highlight\">예술의 정원 회랑</style>에 모여 두 번째 시험을 준비하도록 하십시오.","source_cn":"你们十位记好了：明天<style=highlight>...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBF23FDC3FEE59891","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1610438012:0":{"text":"그럼 내일의 활약을 기대하겠습니다.","source_cn":"我很期待你们明天的表现。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE737E7690B37D13F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:21:1610438013:0":{"text":"발표를 마친 딜그레이는 다시 대형 포탈 너머로 모습을 감췄다","source_cn":"公布完成绩后，迪尔格雷又一次通过大传送门离开了","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x09612167AFE86E8C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1610438014:1":{"text":"다들 축하해! 물론 나도 축하하고! 다 같이 시험을 통과했네!","source_cn":"恭喜各位，当然也恭喜我自己，我们都通过了今天的选拔！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x39B5B2747E9C10F3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_s